# The image build needs the Rust workspace and the packaging scripts only. Allowlist, so that
# model weights, conversion outputs, node_modules and target/ never reach the build context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!.cargo/
!rust-toolchain.toml
!LICENSE
!README.md
!scripts/package.sh
!scripts/llama-cpp.sh
!packaging/
!skills/

**/target/
**/*.onnx
**/*.onnx.data
**/*.safetensors
